# Frontend (timeline SPA) build env (Vite). Copy to .env and fill in.

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (looks like "G-XXXXXXXXXX") — the SAME id the
# landing page uses, so one value tracks both the marketing site and the app.
# Tracking is CLOUD-ONLY: the app only loads GA when deploymentMode === 'cloud',
# so local `npx pierre-review` installs never phone home. Leave empty to disable.
# Set this in the environment of your CLOUD build (e.g. Railway build env) so it's
# baked into both the landing and frontend bundles.
VITE_GA_ID=
